(81, 'THOMAS NEALEY', 'TOM@NEALEYSADDLE.COM', 'INQUIRY', 'Hello, my name is Thomas Nealey, owner of Nealey Saddles. I’m interested in learning more about your investment management services and would like to understand your investment strategies, pricing and fee structure, minimum investment requirements, risk management approach, and expected reporting or communication with clients. I also have an existing investment portfolio that I can provide for review. Please let me know how your onboarding process works and what information you would need from me to get started.'),
(82, 'Sarah Dyer', 'sarah@thebrandbytetech.com', 'Build Your Next Digital Solution With Us', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nLooking for a professional website to grow your business online?\r\n\r\nAt The Brandbyte, we create fast, modern, and user-friendly websites designed to help businesses build a strong online presence.\r\n\r\nWhether you need a new website or want to improve your existing one, our team is ready to help.\r\n\r\nLet’s discuss your website goals and find the right solution for your business.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nSarah Dyer\r\nThe Brandbyte\r\nsarah@thebrandbytetech.com\r\n\r\nRespond with stop to optout.'),
